On Sep 2, 2009, at 10:38 , Ilhami Visne wrote:

>> Yes, that is the default.
> I'm confused. Is it a "Yes" to "I guess this is not possible" or to  
> "Is it possible to  sink to a java output stream"?
>

Yes, it is possible since it is the default. More precisely both  
streams are directed to Java by default so you can write it to any  
output stream you want. If you just pass it to use out/err accordingly  
then you can even join both Java and R output into one stream (and  
redirect it anywhere).

Cheers,
Simon

