Any basic Java book would help - the class name is "PlotDemo", not  
"JRclient.examples.PlotDemo". So what you really want to run is  
something like
java -cp ../JRclient.jar:. PlotDemo

Also please note that you're looking at the obsolete API (deprecated  
for several years now). If you are really thinking about using Rserve,  
you should be looking at the REngine-based client in java-new instead  
of java-old. There you would just type "make PlotDemo".

Cheers,
Simon


